    ],
    "decision": "No ternary pressure-prediction bridge was added. In pinned teqp v0.23.1, mix_VLE_Tx is explicitly documented as binary-only and hard-codes four residual/Jacobian rows, so it cannot solve a ternary bubble pressure from specified liquid composition. mix_VLE_Tp accepts N components but fixes experimental T and P and therefore can only polish compositions, not independently predict pressure; mixture_VLE_px fixes pressure and liquid composition and solves temperature. Neighboring Ottøy rows cannot remove this missing ternary pressure-specification equation/API. A new thermodynamic solver would be required and is outside the evidence-backed scope."
